Subject: New BCPL compiler available!
Message-ID: <02009.AA02009@babylon>
Date: 31 Mar 90 05:04:01 GMT
Lines: 9

After a long period of silence, Metacomco - creator of the
AmigaDOS - has just released a new object-oriented version
of their BCPL compiler, including source-level debugger and
Global Vector Optimizer. Anyone out there who wants to buy
my Lattice C 5.05 and C++?

Ralph

